{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "esnext",
    "module": "esnext",
    "strict": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "moduleResolution": "node",
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "allowJs": true,
    "useDefineForClassFields": true,
    "sourceMap": true,
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./src/*"],
      "@ipc/*": ["../ipc/*"]
    },
    "types": ["vite/client", "node"],
    "lib": ["esnext", "dom", "dom.iterable"]
  },
  "_comment_include_test": "測試檔一起檢查。vitest 用 esbuild 轉譯,型別是直接丟掉的,所以測試裡的型別錯誤在跑測試時完全看不到。手寫的替身尤其危險:少一個欄位、形狀對不上,測試照樣全綠,但測的是一個現實中不存在的物件 —— test/stat-roll-total.test.ts 的第一版就漏了 ModifierInfo.tags,是這道檢查抓到的。",
  "include": [
    "src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.d.ts", "src/**/*.vue",
    "test/**/*.ts",
    "public/data/*/client_strings.js"
  ],
  "references": [{ "path": "./tsconfig.node.json" }]
}
